    <worksheet name="11. Ward x Program Heatmap">
      <layout-options>
        <title>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold="true" fontsize="12">Avg business days by ward and program</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </title>
      </layout-options>
      <table>
        <view>
          <datasources>
            <datasource caption="FY26 New Issued Permits" name="federated.0fy26permits0approval0times" />
          </datasources>
          <datasource-dependencies datasource="federated.0fy26permits0approval0times">
            <column datatype="string" name="[Ward]" role="dimension" type="nominal" />
            <column caption="Lead Free DC Program" datatype="string" name="[LeadFreeDC]" role="dimension" type="nominal" />
            <column caption="Business Days to Approve" datatype="integer" name="[BusDaysToApprove]" role="measure" type="quantitative" />
            <column datatype="integer" name="[OBJECTID]" role="dimension" type="ordinal" />
            <column caption="Avg Business Days to Approve" datatype='real' default-format="n#,##0.0" name="[Calc_AvgApprove]" role='measure' type='quantitative'><calculation class='tableau' formula="AVG([BusDaysToApprove])" /></column>
            <column caption="Permits" datatype='real' default-format="n#,##0" name="[Calc_Permits]" role='measure' type='quantitative'><calculation class='tableau' formula="COUNTD([OBJECTID])" /></column>
            <column caption="Median Business Days to Approve" datatype='real' default-format="n#,##0.0" name="[Calc_MedianApprove]" role='measure' type='quantitative'><calculation class='tableau' formula="MEDIAN([BusDaysToApprove])" /></column>
            <column-instance column="[LeadFreeDC]" derivation="None" name="[none:LeadFreeDC:nk]" pivot='key' type="nominal" />
            <column-instance column="[Ward]" derivation="None" name="[none:Ward:nk]" pivot='key' type="nominal" />
            <column-instance column="[Calc_AvgApprove]" derivation="User" name="[usr:Calc_AvgApprove:qk]" pivot='key' type="quantitative" />
            <column-instance column="[Calc_MedianApprove]" derivation="User" name="[usr:Calc_MedianApprove:qk]" pivot='key' type="quantitative" />
            <column-instance column="[Calc_Permits]" derivation="User" name="[usr:Calc_Permits:qk]" pivot='key' type="quantitative" />
          </datasource-dependencies>
          <aggregation value='true' />
        </view>
        <style />
        <panes>
          <pane selection-relaxation-option='selection-relaxation-allow'>
            <view>
              <breakdown value='auto' />
            </view>
            <mark class="Square" />
              <encodings>
                <color column="[federated.0fy26permits0approval0times].[usr:Calc_AvgApprove:qk]" />
                <text column="[federated.0fy26permits0approval0times].[usr:Calc_AvgApprove:qk]" />
                <tooltip column="[federated.0fy26permits0approval0times].[usr:Calc_Permits:qk]" />
                <tooltip column="[federated.0fy26permits0approval0times].[usr:Calc_MedianApprove:qk]" />
              </encodings>
              <style>
                <style-rule element='mark'>
                  <format attr='mark-labels-show' value='true' />
                </style-rule>
              </style>
          </pane>
        </panes>
        <rows>[federated.0fy26permits0approval0times].[none:Ward:nk]</rows>
        <cols>[federated.0fy26permits0approval0times].[none:LeadFreeDC:nk]</cols>
      </table>
    </worksheet>
  </worksheets>
  <dashboards>
    <dashboard name='FY26 Permit Approval Dashboard'>
      <style />
      <size maxheight='1760' maxwidth='1600' minheight='1760' minwidth='1200' sizing-mode='range' />
      <datasources />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='2' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
<zone h='100000' id='24' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
<zone fixed-size='75' is-fixed='true' h='4261' id='3' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='0'><formatted-text><run bold="true" fontsize="20" fontcolor="#1f3b57">Public Space Construction Permits: FY26 Average Business Days to Approve</run><run>Æ&#10;</run><run fontsize="9" fontcolor="#777777">DDOT Public Space Division  |  Analytics, Assets, and Performance Branch  |  Source: DC GIS TOPS feed (MapServer/23), pulled Nov 2026</run></formatted-text></zone>
<zone fixed-size='50' is-fixed='true' h='2841' id='4' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='4261'><formatted-text><run bold="true" fontsize="9">How to read this: </run><run fontsize="9">Scope is new permits (no renewals) applied for on or after Oct 1, 2025 and issued in FY26 (Oct 1, 2025 - Sep 30, 2026): 11,206 permits. Business days = days from application to final approval, excluding weekends and DC holidays (same-day approval = 0). Hover any mark for permit counts, median and days to issuance.</run></formatted-text></zone>
<zone fixed-size='48' is-fixed='true' h='2727' id='5' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='7102'><formatted-text><run bold="true" fontsize="13" fontcolor="#1f3b57">1. Overall performance</run><run fontsize="9" fontcolor="#555555">   The FY26 average, and how widely approval times are spread around it.</run></formatted-text></zone>
<zone fixed-size='280' is-fixed='true' h='15909' id='8' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='100000' x='0' y='9829'>
<zone fixed-size='500' is-fixed='true' h='15909' id='6' name="1. Overall Avg Business Days" w='34000' x='0' y='9829' />
<zone h='15909' id='7' name="5. Approval Time Distribution" w='66000' x='34000' y='9829' />
</zone>
<zone fixed-size='48' is-fixed='true' h='2727' id='9' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='25738'><formatted-text><run bold="true" fontsize="13" fontcolor="#1f3b57">2. Approval time by permit type category</run><run fontsize="9" fontcolor="#555555">   Permit type is derived from the line items on each permit. Lead service line replacements (DC Water's Lead Free DC program) are 84% of permits and drive the overall average.</run></formatted-text></zone>
<zone fixed-size='290' is-fixed='true' h='16477' id='12' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='100000' x='0' y='28465'>
<zone h='16477' id='10' name="2. Avg Days by Permit Type" w='50000' x='0' y='28465' />
<zone h='16477' id='11' name="3. Lead Free DC vs All Other" w='50000' x='50000' y='28465' />
</zone>
<zone fixed-size='48' is-fixed='true' h='2727' id='13' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='44942'><formatted-text><run bold="true" fontsize="13" fontcolor="#1f3b57">3. Other segments worth exploring</run><run fontsize="9" fontcolor="#555555">   Applicant, timing and stage of the process show where approval times are meaningfully different.</run></formatted-text></zone>
<zone fixed-size='290' is-fixed='true' h='16477' id='17' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='100000' x='0' y='47669'>
<zone h='16477' id='14' name="4. Avg Days by Applicant" w='34000' x='0' y='47669' />
<zone h='16477' id='15' name="6. Trend by Application Month" w='33000' x='34000' y='47669' />
<zone h='16477' id='16' name="8. Approval vs Issuance by Applicant" w='33000' x='67000' y='47669' />
</zone>
<zone fixed-size='48' is-fixed='true' h='2727' id='18' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='64146'><formatted-text><run bold="true" fontsize="13" fontcolor="#1f3b57">4. Where approval times are meaningfully different</run><run fontsize="9" fontcolor="#555555">   Segments with 30+ permits whose average is 7+ business days above (orange) or below (blue) the average. The middle chart removes Lead Free DC so program mix doesn't drive the result.</run></formatted-text></zone>
<zone fixed-size='430' is-fixed='true' h='24432' id='22' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='100000' x='0' y='66873'>
<zone h='24432' id='19' name="9. Segments vs FY26 Average" w='37000' x='0' y='66873' />
<zone h='24432' id='20' name="10. Segments excl. Lead Free DC" w='37000' x='37000' y='66873' />
<zone h='24432' id='21' name="11. Ward x Program Heatmap" w='26000' x='74000' y='66873' />
</zone>
<zone h='8695' id='23' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='91305'><formatted-text><run bold="true" fontsize="12" fontcolor="#1f3b57">Key insights and next steps</run><run>Æ&#10;</run><run fontsize="9">- Overall: 43.8 business days on average (median 39); only 3% are approved the same day and 24% take more than 60 business days.</run><run>Æ&#10;</run><run fontsize="9">- Lead Free DC permits average 48.4 days vs. 19.5 for all other permits; most of the FY26 backlog is one program. Gas (10.0), water/sewer (19.1) and electric/telecom (25.2) utility work is approved much faster.</run><run>Æ&#10;</run><run fontsize="9">- Washington Gas is approved in 11.5 days but waits 45 more days on average between approval and issuance (payment / pick-up stage), so its total time is similar to other groups.</run><run>Æ&#10;</run><run fontsize="9">- Meaningfully slower (7+ days above average): Public Space Committee review (72.0), Q1-Q2 applications (69-71), Ward 3 (60.1), other excavation (57.8). Meaningfully faster: DC Water non-lead work (5.2), gas (10.0), single-line-item permits (14.2), Ward 8 (28.4).</run><run>Æ&#10;</run><run fontsize="9">- Ward differences come from the Lead Free DC program (Ward 3: 68.9 vs. Ward 8: 30.2). For all other permits every ward is 15-24 days. Later months look faster partly because only permits issued by Sep 30 are included. Next: investigate the Lead Free DC queue by ward and the Q1-Q2 backlog.</run></formatted-text></zone>
</zone>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <devicelayouts>
        <devicelayout name='Tablet'>
          <size sizing-mode='automatic' />
        </devicelayout>
      </devicelayouts>
    </dashboard>
  </dashboards>
